  "description": "Web Push for Elarion (RFC 8030/8291/8292, ADR-0076): VAPID key management (configuration → store → generate, race-safe), the IPushSubscriptionStore seam with an in-memory default, and IWebPushSender — aes128gcm encryption and VAPID signing on the .NET crypto primitives, bounded fan-out, and cleanup of subscriptions the push service reports gone. No third-party push SDK.",
